{"4082710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last 7 Days", "steam_appid": 4082710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last 7 Days is an open-world, zombie-themed, 3rd-person co-op survival game where 1–4 players try to survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to survive by collecting loot on a vast map and traveling to different areas on horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days progress, zombie attacks become stronger, resources dwindle, the weather changes, and players enter a true struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ 1–4 player Online Co-op &amp; LAN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, share quests, and survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Open World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, villages, abandoned structures, and hidden loot areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ PvE Combat in a Zombie-Filled World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More difficult, larger waves of zombies every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Horseback Riding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel quickly around the map, escape, chase, and reach loot points quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Dark &amp; ​​Tense Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things change at night. Light and intelligence become even more critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Realistic Visuals (UE5)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality models, dark atmosphere, and detailed environments.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last 7 Days is an open-world, zombie-themed, 3rd-person co-op survival game where 1–4 players try to survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to survive by collecting loot on a vast map and traveling to different areas on horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days progress, zombie attacks become stronger, resources dwindle, 